{"id":"wb-1-8","name":"北京大学红楼","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"北京大学红楼","text":"北京大学红楼位于中华人民共和国北京市东城区景山街道五四大街29号，为北京大学老校舍之一，也是五四运动的主要活动场所之一。现为北京鲁迅博物馆（北京新文化运动纪念馆）新文化运动纪念馆馆区，暨中国共产党早期北京革命活动纪念馆。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8C%97%E4%BA%AC%E5%A4%A7%E5%AD%A6%E7%BA%A2%E6%A5%BC","revisionId":94057406,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94057406","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/c531a2cab4f6bb75cb55442a.jpg","title":"Red_building_of_Peking_University.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Red_building_of_Peking_University.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/9d/Red_building_of_Peking_University.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Dirrival","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"北京沙滩北大红楼","width":320,"height":240}}